# Root .env.example -- placeholders for the app-level .env (simulator
# settings, Metabase admin session, etc.), distinct from
# infrastructure/docker/.env.example (docker-compose service vars
# only). Started 2026-08-13 with the 2 vars below; the rest of the
# real .env's ~15 existing vars (POSTGRES_*, SIMULATOR_*,
# CUSTOMERS_PER_BATCH, etc.) predate this file and aren't retrofitted
# here yet -- same kind of gap infrastructure/docker/.env.example had
# before its own 2026-08-12 audit (see git history,
# "docs(env): document 12 vars missing from .env.example"), left as a
# separate follow-up rather than folded into this change.

# Metabase admin session credential (POST /api/session) -- used to
# script per-card visualization_settings via the API, same discipline
# as dashboards/metabase/ being SQL-as-code instead of UI-only. Real
# value is whatever this Metabase instance's admin account actually
# is -- there's no Terraform output or fixed default for this one.
METABASE_ADMIN_EMAIL=
METABASE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
